{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XeREM7gN7m6kUzPmJp9XDd","type":"tool_result","content":"---\ntitle: Coding Session\ntype: schema\npermalink: ms/schemas/coding-session\nentity: CodingSession\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  summary?: string, one-paragraph what happened in this coding session\n  changed_file?(array): string, files created, edited, deleted, or inspected\n  verification?(array): string, checks run and their result\n  decision?(array): string, decisions surfaced or created during the session\n  blocker?(array): string, unresolved blockers or failed approaches\n  next_step?(array): string, explicit cursor for the next coding session\n  produced?(array): Entity, notes or artifacts created or updated\nsettings:\n  validation: warn\n  frontmatter:\n    project: string, the Basic Memory project this session belongs to\n    started: string, when the session began or checkpoint was created\n    repository: string, stable repository identifier such as owner/name\nNo results in project 'ms'.\nResults in project 'ms':\n- schemas/Coding Session.md | Coding Session\ninbox: /tmp/ep-unqvhnt0/home/.basic-memory/inbox\npending envelopes: 1\narchived envelopes: 0\nlast flush: never\nsettings (claude, /tmp/ep-unqvhnt0/work/ms): found\nprimary project: ms\nsession profile: coding\nrepository: ms\ncheckpoint on compact: off\ncapture events: on\ncapture folder: sessions\nbasic-memory version: 1.0.0\nuv: uv 0.13.7 (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"816d086a-0f15-4b03-9f76-99de26f9756b","uuid":"5b702840-3799-45c0-9257-67efe2718ceb","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:43:53.195Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\ntitle: Coding Session\ntype: schema\npermalink: ms/schemas/coding-session\nentity: CodingSession\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  summary?: string, one-paragraph what happened in this coding session\n  changed_file?(array): string, files created, edited, deleted, or inspected\n  verification?(array): string, checks run and their result\n  decision?(array): string, decisions surfaced or created during the session\n  blocker?(array): string, unresolved blockers or failed approaches\n  next_step?(array): string, explicit cursor for the next coding session\n  produced?(array): Entity, notes or artifacts created or updated\nsettings:\n  validation: warn\n  frontmatter:\n    project: string, the Basic Memory project this session belongs to\n    started: string, when the session began or checkpoint was created\n    repository: string, stable repository identifier such as owner/name\nNo results in project 'ms'.\nResults in project 'ms':\n- schemas/Coding Session.md | Coding Session\ninbox: /tmp/ep-unqvhnt0/home/.basic-memory/inbox\npending envelopes: 1\narchived envelopes: 0\nlast flush: never\nsettings (claude, /tmp/ep-unqvhnt0/work/ms): found\nprimary project: ms\nsession profile: coding\nrepository: ms\ncheckpoint on compact: off\ncapture events: on\ncapture folder: sessions\nbasic-memory version: 1.0.0\nuv: uv 0.13.7 (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XeREM7gN7m6kUzPmJp9XDd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggxjNeKioQSAQHi7J1Rg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic Memory is set up for this project. Two things to know: the smoke test caught one gap, and the output-style behavior won't start until you restart the session.\n\n- **Project:** I created a new local project, `ms`, at `~/bm-projects/ms`. The suggested `~/basic-memory/ms` overlapped the existing `main` project, which Basic Memory doesn't allow.\n- **Profile:** coding, with `repository: \"ms\"` (the directory name, since there's no git remote).\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task, and none existed before. The schema fields are stored as nested YAML on disk, not as the `'[object Object]'` string the skill warns about. The `bm_read` JSON call returned `frontmatter: null`, so I checked the file directly.\n- **Placement:** this is a new project, so I wrote a light starting structure into the settings: `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `sessions/`, `notes/` and `bm-remember/`. It's a suggestion, and the folders only appear once notes land in them.\n- **Shared skills:** installed the `memory-*` skills globally with `npx skills add basicmachines-co/basic-memory/skills -g`.\n- **Settings:** I wrote them to `.claude/settings.local.json`, which is personal, not committed. They include `captureEvents: true` and `outputStyle: \"basic-memory\"`.\n- **Smoke test:**\n  - The open-decision query ran cleanly and returned 0 results.\n  - The schema query found the Coding Session schema.\n  - The hook status finds the settings and reports project `ms`, profile `coding` and capture on.\n  - **Gap:** it shows \"checkpoint on compact: off\", although I set `preCompactCapture` to `\"extractive\"`. The PreCompact checkpoint may not fire until that's sorted out.\n- **Hook inbox:** 1 pending envelope, 0 archived, and no flush has run yet. The count includes envelopes from every supported harness.\n\nRecall is live now. Restart the session to activate the proactive-capture reflexes from the output style.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":747,"cache_read_input_tokens":38625,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":747},"output_tokens":736,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"816d086a-0f15-4b03-9f76-99de26f9756b","uuid":"48e3794b-7865-4b08-a9d0-0d0b07fc4988","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:43:58.895Z","request_id":"req_011CggxjNQRnYmcDc2SZe912"}
